PARITY_COVERED=30

All 30 panels/states/strings render from the bound @Observable SecretRotationPageModel +
the Localizable.xcstrings catalog; web key names preserved verbatim (verified: each of the
21 required keys resolves in the catalog AND is referenced at >=1 Swift call site). The
value types (SecretRotationStatus / SecretRotationReport / SecretRotationSeverity) mirror
the Go rotation.Status + web SecretRotationStatus field-for-field, so the production
`OperatorConfidenceStore.secretRotation()` binding drops into the SecretRotationDataSource
seam (ADR-004 — no networking in the view), the same seam pattern the sibling DiskForecast/
SchemaDrift pages use. SI converters: N/A — rotation age/threshold/expiry are unit-agnostic
day counts (Go int), formatted at the display boundary by SecretRotationFormat (fmtNumber
2dp/en-US grouping, formatDateTime, formatRelative) — never miles/kWh/etc. Live-SSE
staleness: N/A — secret rotation is a pull/refresh report (web polls at SLOW 60s), not a
live stream (ADR-013 scope). Adaptive (ADR-002/006): macOS/iPad regular width -> columnar
Grid table + adaptive stat grid; compact iPhone -> per-secret TSCards + single-column stats
(SecretRotationPage.Table.swift isCompact). a11y: panels are accessibility containers with
header labels; the severity badge + rows combine children; Dynamic Type via Font.TS; light/
dark + increased-contrast via the design-token colors (Color.TS / TSTone).

